---
// Plaque de rue en azulejos, comme les numéros peints des maisons portugaises.
---
<div class="plaque relative bg-glacure p-3 text-cobalt">
  <div class="relative border-[3px] border-cobalt px-6 pb-6 pt-4 text-center outline outline-1 outline-offset-[-10px] outline-cobalt-clair sm:px-8">
    <span class="coin left-[-3px] top-[-3px]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="coin right-[-3px] top-[-3px]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="coin bottom-[-3px] left-[-3px]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="coin bottom-[-3px] right-[-3px]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <p class="titre text-[7rem] leading-none [font-variant-numeric:lining-nums] sm:text-[8.5rem]">93</p>
    <p class="titre mt-2 text-[1.6rem] font-bold">avenue de Domont</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-[0.95rem] font-semibold text-encre">95160 Montmorency</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-3 border-[3px] border-cobalt bg-chaux px-4 py-3 text-left text-encre">
    <p data-statut class="text-[1.05rem]">
      <span class="pastille" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span>Midi du mardi au samedi, soir le vendredi et le samedi</span>
    </p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-[0.95rem] text-encre/85">Le soir, réservation recommandée.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<style>
  .coin {
    position: absolute;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    background: url('/azulejo.svg') center / 88px 88px;
    border: 3px solid var(--color-cobalt);
  }
</style>
